==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.13~1 seconds<sup>4f~30f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~60 seconds<sup>400f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 60~80 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**4 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**6 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is the exact same as [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] from [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3, a similar strategy can be used, which is to spam meatshields while stacking ranged attackers to deal damage to Bun Bun. The difficulty in this stage comes from the enemies' strength magnifications, which are much higher than on the Moon. By now though, you should have much more options for ranged attackers and higher levels, which balances out the difficulty. Since you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]], this stage should definitely not be that hard.

